{
 "_readme": [
  "Cossacks 3 singleplayer port - the global settings of the whole game.",
  "This file is read when the game starts, before anything is built.",
  "Change a number here, save the file, start the game: the new number is used.",
  "Every key is optional - a key you delete keeps the number from the original game.",
  "The units and buildings take their numbers from the original game's own data files",
  "(data/scripts/lib/unit.script, weapon.script); the sources are in MECHANICS.md.",
  "Start the game with --dump-config to see the settings it is running with.",
  "display.unit_scale: unit sprite size relative to donor-scale buildings (1.25 default).",
  "display.show_centroids: flat round anchor disks under buildings and trees (false = hidden).",
  "display.units_opaque: solid, normally-coloured unit figures (true default).",
  "gameplay.render_mode: port-side renderer switch. This is the 3D variant project, so it defaults to 3d here; the 2D shipping port in app/ keeps 2d. No donor key exists.",
  "camera.start_zoom: starting camera zoom. 0.3448276 = donor SphereHeight 58 m maximum distance (docreate.inc:82), i.e. the most zoomed-out donor-legal start; smaller is not donor-grounded."
 ],
